<workout_file><author>mywhooshinfo.com</author><name>Anaerobic into Sweet Spot</name><description>Along with challenging your fitness by going from a short Anaerobic effort into a sustained Tempo effort, this session adds to that adaptation by including a significant difference in cadence. 

